{"anchorId":3058,"message":"The exposed root collar reveals a dense mat of pale mycelial threads, suggesting vigorous fungal colonization despite the compacted London clay, while the bracket fungi emerging at chest height indicate this ancient plane is still channeling resources through its fungal partners rather than declining—a reminder that what appears as a single tree is actually a complex trading post where nutrients and signals flow both upward and into the darker networks below.","witnessAddress":"0x96898Ad82aAe32ffD5fCA73a7f97c2D1AFac7F13","timestamp":"2026-03-20T23:20:30.108Z","secretVerified":true}